            <h3>Implementation Details</h3>
            <ul style="color:var(--text-secondary); margin-left:20px;">
                <li>Implemented <strong>Deep Q-Network (DQN)</strong> with Experience Replay to stabilize training.</li>
                <li>Utilized Target Networks to prevent Q-value oscillation.</li>
                <li>Optimized hyperparameters (epsilon-decay, learning rate, batch size) for faster convergence.</li>
                <li>Achieved a consistent landing score of >200 over 100 consecutive episodes.</li>
            </ul>
